{"stage": {"name": "有理数混合运算 · 三场景互动与媒体验收（自编开发课稿）"}, "scenes": [{"id": "rational-0", "title": "先确定运算顺序", "content": {"canvas": {"viewportSize": 1000, "viewportRatio": 0.5625, "elements": [{"id": "title0", "type": "text", "left": 50, "top": 35, "width": 900, "height": 70, "content": "<p style=\"font-size:36px\">先确定运算顺序</p>"}, {"id": "body0", "type": "text", "left": 50, "top": 140, "width": 900, "height": 140, "content": "<p style=\"font-size:26px\">没有括号时，先乘除，再加减。同级运算从左到右。</p>"}, {"id": "formula0", "type": "latex", "left": 50, "top": 320, "width": 900, "height": 120, "latex": "-2+3\\times4=10"}]}}, "actions": [{"type": "speech", "text": "先判断负二加三乘四应先做哪一步。先乘三和四，再与负二相加。"}, {"type": "spotlight", "elementId": "formula0"}, {"type": "question", "id": "question0", "text": "计算 -2+3×4，结果是多少？", "answer": "10"}]}, {"id": "rational-1", "title": "除法转乘法", "content": {"canvas": {"viewportSize": 1000, "viewportRatio": 0.5625, "elements": [{"id": "title1", "type": "text", "left": 50, "top": 35, "width": 900, "height": 70, "content": "<p style=\"font-size:36px\">除法转乘法</p>"}, {"id": "body1", "type": "text", "left": 50, "top": 140, "width": 900, "height": 140, "content": "<p style=\"font-size:26px\">除数不能为零。除以一个非零数，等于乘它的倒数。</p>"}, {"id": "formula1", "type": "latex", "left": 50, "top": 320, "width": 900, "height": 120, "latex": "(-6)\\div(-2)=(-6)\\times(-\\frac12)=3"}]}}, "actions": [{"type": "speech", "text": "先看两个数的符号，再处理绝对值。负数除以负数得到正数，最后核对结果。"}, {"type": "spotlight", "elementId": "formula1"}, {"type": "question", "id": "question1", "text": "负六除以负二，结果是多少？", "answer": "3"}]}, {"id": "rational-2", "title": "检验与迁移", "content": {"canvas": {"viewportSize": 1000, "viewportRatio": 0.5625, "elements": [{"id": "title2", "type": "text", "left": 50, "top": 35, "width": 900, "height": 70, "content": "<p style=\"font-size:36px\">检验与迁移</p>"}, {"id": "body2", "type": "text", "left": 50, "top": 140, "width": 900, "height": 140, "content": "<p style=\"font-size:26px\">先写顺序，再算数值，最后用另一种方式检查。</p>"}, {"id": "formula2", "type": "latex", "left": 50, "top": 320, "width": 900, "height": 120, "latex": "(-2+3)\\times4=4"}]}}, "actions": [{"type": "speech", "text": "加入括号后，应先算括号内。比较这道题与第一道题，说明为什么顺序不同。"}, {"type": "spotlight", "elementId": "formula2"}, {"type": "question", "id": "question2", "text": "计算 (-2+3)×4，结果是多少？", "answer": "4"}]}]}